:: intro1 [nobr]
<<set $prevpass to "landing">>
<<set $pass to "intro1">>
<<set $nextpass to "game1-landing">>

<<include "_templateIntro">>


:: intro1-text [nobr]
<<timed 0.2s>>
    <<append "#audio">><<if $userchoices.audioOn is true>><audio src="assets/audio/Intro.mp3" autoplay id="bgAudio">Audio is not supported on your device</audio><</if>><</append>>
    <</timed>>
    <br/>
<p>Hello</p>
<p>We are students from across different years</p>
<p>We’ve made this for you as we’ve been where you are. </p>
<p>We’ve all been new here and we know how you might be feeling</p>
<p>Nervous, excited, slightly confused!</p>
<p>All of which is ok. </p>
<p>It would be odd if you didn’t feel a mix of all those things. </p>
<br/>
<p>We’ve made this Welcome Game</p>
<p>A game to help you settle in</p>
<p>Make you feel at ease</p>
<p>To welcome you. </p>
<p>To Harris Academy Kingswood.</p>
<br/>
<p>It’ll have some tips to help being in a massive school</p>
<p>And some tools to remember your timetable</p>
<p>But also, it’ll have games. </p>
<p>And with games - there’s prizes. </p>
<p>Complete our challenges then you get a prize. </p>
<br/>
<p>Shall we get started? </p>
<br/>
<<button "Start">>
    <<goto $nextpass>>
    <</button>>


:: game1-landing [nobr]
<<set $prevpass to "intro1">>
<<set $pass to "game1-landing">>
<<set $nextpass to "game1-intro">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>
<<set $currentGame = $games[1]>>
<<include "_templateGameLanding">>




:: game1-intro [nobr]
<<set $prevpass to "game1-landing">>
<<set $pass to "game1-intro">>
<<set $nextpass to "game1">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>


<<include "_templateStory">>

:: game1-intro-text [nobr]
  <<timed 0.1s>>
    <<append "#audio">><<if $userchoices.audioOn is true>><audio src="assets/audio/Game_1_Intro.mp3" autoplay id="bgAudio">Audio is not supported on your device</audio><</if>><</append>>
    <</timed>>


<p>Welcome to <b>‘And You Are?’ The Game</b> </p>
<p>This game is a bit like heads down thumbs up - but we’ve changed it!</p>
<p>You will place your head down on the desk</p>
<p>There will be statements on the screen, which your teacher will read out. </p>
<p>If you agree or have something in common with that statement, raise your head and look at who else has their heads raised. </p>
<p>You can’t speak - but you can make eye contact with that person</p>
<p>Then put your head down again, the teacher click ‘Next’ to reveal the next statement! </p>
<br/>
<p>Ready? Then get your heads on the table and let’s begin! </p>
<<button "Ready">>
    <<goto $nextpass>>
    <</button>>

:: game1 [nobr]

<<set $prevpass = "game1-intro">>
<<set $pass = "game1">>
<<set $nextpass = "game1-outro">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>
<<addclass "body" "white eyes">>

<<if $statementsGame1 is undefined>>
<<set $statementsGame1 = [
"Have a sibling",
"Likes watching films",
"Enjoy art",
"Has a friend in the class",
"Supports a football team",
"Is organised",
"Enjoys coming to school",
"Have a hidden talent",
"Likes to play sports",
"Likes listening to music"
]>>
<</if>>

<<if $statementIndexGame1 is undefined>>
<<set $statementIndexGame1 = 0>>
<</if>>

<main class="game1">
<div id="gameArea1">
    <<include "game1-content">>
</div>

</main>

<<include "navbuttonsb">>

:: game1-content [nobr]



    <div class="statement">
      <p>  <<= $statementsGame1[$statementIndexGame1]>></p>
    </div>

    <div class="buttons-container">

     <<if $statementIndexGame1 === 0>>
        <<button "Back">>
       
        <</button>>
    <</if>>

    <<if $statementIndexGame1 gt 0>>
        <<button "Back">>
            <<set $statementIndexGame1-->>
            <<replace "#gameArea1">>
                <<include "game1-content">>
            <</replace>>
        <</button>>
    <</if>>

    <<if $statementIndexGame1 lt $statementsGame1.length - 1>>

        <<button "Next">>
            <<set $statementIndexGame1++>>
            <<replace "#gameArea1">>
                <<include "game1-content">>
            <</replace>>
        <</button>>

    <<else>>

        <<button "Finish">>
           <<goto $nextpass>>
        <</button>>

      

    <</if>>

    </div>



:: game1-outro [nobr]
<<set $prevpass to "game1">>
<<set $pass to "game1-outro">>
<<set $nextpass to "game2-landing">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>
<<addclass "body" "lime">>
<<set $currentGame = $games[1]>>
<<include "_templateStory">>

:: game1-outro-text [nobr]
  <<timed 0.1s>>
    <<append "#audio">><<if $userchoices.audioOn is true>><audio src="assets/audio/Game_1_Outro.mp3" autoplay id="bgAudio">Audio is not supported on your device</audio><</if>><</append>>
    <</timed>>
<div id="msgMount">
</div>
<p>Thanks for playing. </p>
<p>When we made these games, we played and then reflected. </p>
<p>You might want to do that now. </p>
<p>Can you find something you would all put your head up for? And if so, what would it be?  </p>
<p>Something you all connect on.</p>
<p>When ready to move on, click ‘next’ for the next game. </p>
<br/>
<<button "Next">>
    <<goto $nextpass>>
    <</button>>

:: game2-landing [nobr]
<<set $prevpass to "game1-outro">>
<<set $pass to "game2-landing">>
<<set $nextpass to "game2-intro">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>

<<set $currentGame = $games[2]>>
<<include "_templateGameLanding">>

:: game2-intro [nobr]
<<set $prevpass to "game2-landing">>
<<set $pass to "game2-intro">>
<<set $nextpass to "game2">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>

<<include "_templateStory">>

:: game2-intro-text [nobr]
  <<timed 0.1s>>
    <<append "#audio">><<if $userchoices.audioOn is true>><audio src="assets/audio/Game_2_Intro.mp3" autoplay id="bgAudio">Audio is not supported on your device</audio><</if>><</append>>
    <</timed>>

<p>Welcome to This or That, where you will be faced with a series of statements that you may either agree or disagree with! </p>
<br/>
<p>If you AGREE you stand up and if you DISAGREE then you stay sat down... Simple. </p>
<br/>
<p>For example, one statement could be ‘Does pineapple belong on pizza?’ </p>
<p>A controversial one! </p>
<p>You will have 10 seconds to make your decision. </p>
<br/>
<p>Then, teacher, you have the chance to ask why people chose their answer.</p> 
<p>Ready for the first statement?</p>
<br/>
<<button "Ready">>
    <<goto $nextpass>>
    <</button>>

:: game2 [nobr]

<<set $prevpass = "game2-intro">>
<<set $pass = "game2">>
<<set $nextpass = "game2-outro">>
<<addclass "body" "blue">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>

<<if $statementsGame2 is undefined>>
<<set $statementsGame2 = [
"Is a burger a sandwich?",
"Movies or TV shows?",
"Books or video games?",
"Is it better to be rich, but sad, or poor and happy?",
"Where would you go on holiday….the beach or the mountains?",
]>>
<</if>>

<<set $statementsGame2 = [
    {
    question: "Is a burger a sandwich?",
    left: "Burger",
    right: "Sandwich", 
    leftClass: "burger",
    rightClass: "sandwich"
},
{
    question: "Movies or TV shows?",
    left: "Movies",
    right: "TV Shows", 
     leftClass: "movie",
    rightClass: "tv"
},
{
    question: "Books or video games?",
    left: "Books",
    right: "Video games", 
       leftClass: "books",
    rightClass: "gaming"
},
{
    question: "Is it better to be rich, but sad, or poor and happy?",
    left: "rich, but sad",
    right: "poor and happy?", 
      leftClass: "rich",
    rightClass: "happy"
},
{
    question: "Where would you go on holiday?",
    left: "Beach",
    right: "Mountains", 
     leftClass: "beach",
    rightClass: "mountains"
}


]>>

<<if $statementIndexGame2 is undefined>>
<<set $statementIndexGame2 = 0>>
<</if>>
<br/>
<main>

<<include "game2-content">>

</main>

<<include "navbuttonsb">>

:: game2-content [nobr]

<div id="gameArea2">

   <div class="statement">
    <<= $statementsGame2[$statementIndexGame2].question >>
</div>

<div class="split-screen">

    <div class="side left">
        <div class="choice">
            <<= $statementsGame2[$statementIndexGame2].left >>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="side right">
        <div class="choice">
            <<= $statementsGame2[$statementIndexGame2].right >>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
<br/>
    <div class="buttons">
<<if $statementIndexGame2 === 0>>
        <<button "Back">>
   
        <</button>>
    <</if>>
    <<if $statementIndexGame2 gt 0>>
        <<button "Back">>
            <<set $statementIndexGame2-->>
            <<replace "#gameArea2">>
                <<include "game2-content">>
            <</replace>>
        <</button>>
    <</if>>

    <<if $statementIndexGame2 lt $statementsGame2.length - 1>>

      <<button "Next">>

    <<replace "#gameArea2">>
        <div class="loading">
        <div class="statement">
            Loading...
            </div>
        </div>
    <</replace>>

    <<timed 2s>>
        <<set $statementIndexGame2++>>
        <<replace "#gameArea2">>
            <<include "game2-content">>
        <</replace>>
    <</timed>>

<</button>>

    <<else>>
          <<button "Next">>
            <<goto $nextpass>>
        <</button>>


    <</if>>

    </div>

</div>
<<done>>

<<addclass ".left" $statementsGame2[$statementIndexGame2].leftClass>>
<<addclass ".right" $statementsGame2[$statementIndexGame2].rightClass>>
<</done>>

:: game2-outro [nobr]
<<set $prevpass to "game2">>
<<set $pass to "game2-outro">>
<<set $nextpass to "game3-landing">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>
<<set $currentGame = $games[2]>>
<<include "_templateStory">>

:: game2-outro-text [nobr]
  <<timed 0.1s>>
    <<append "#audio">><<if $userchoices.audioOn is true>><audio src="assets/audio/Game_2_Outro.mp3" autoplay id="bgAudio">Audio is not supported on your device</audio><</if>><</append>>
    <</timed>>
<p>Thank you for playing This or That. </p>
<p>Your time here will be filled with making decisions</p>
<p>Sometimes you will agree with others and sometimes you won’t.</p> 
<p>We should try to keep calm and allow other people to express their own opinions. </p>
<br/>
<p>We hope you’ve made some connections - and maybe learnt a bit about the rest of your form group too. </p>
<p>Maybe you should all order a pineapple pizza now, or not? </p>
<p>When ready to move on, click ‘next’ for the next game. </p>

<br/>
<<button "Next">>
    <<goto $nextpass>>
    <</button>>


:: game3-landing [nobr]
<<set $prevpass to "game2-outro">>
<<set $pass to "game3-landing">>
<<set $nextpass to "game3-intro">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>

<<set $currentGame = $games[3]>>
<<include "_templateGameLanding">>

:: game3-intro [nobr]
<<set $prevpass to "game3-landing">>
<<set $pass to "game3-intro">>
<<set $nextpass to "game3">>
<<audio ":all" "stop">>

<<include "_templateStory">>

:: game3-intro-text [nobr]
  <<timed 0.1s>>
    <<append "#audio">><<if $userchoices.audioOn is true>><audio src="assets/audio/Game_3_Intro.mp3" autoplay id="bgAudio">Audio is not supported on your device</audio><</if>><</append>>
    <</timed>>

<p>Knowing where you need to be and when is going to help you here. </p>
<p>So memorising your timetable is going to be super helpful.</p> 
<p>Don’t worry if that feels daunting?</p>
<p>We’ve got you covered - with our game MEMORY. </p>
<br/>
<p>It’s simple, on the screen there will be 5 items - you need to memorise them. </p>
<p>We recommend playing in pairs/small groups - but it’s up to your teacher. </p>
<p>Write down the items and the order. </p>
<p>Get them right, get a point. </p>
<p>Most points WINS. </p>
<p>Good luck. </p>
<br/>
<<button "Ready">>
    <<goto $nextpass>>
    <</button>>

